OL,5,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIn Blackpool, Paul and entertainer
OL,7,     FVictoria are keen to extol the
OL,8,     Fvirtues of the seaside town, via
OL,9,     Fthe mediums of bingo and karaoke.
OL,10,G1030 Four in a Bed
OL,11,     FThe week's final visit is to Simon
OL,12,     Fand Lana's lodges in Yorkshire,
OL,13,     Fwhere the hosts pride themselves
OL,14,     Fon luxury. But one guest compares
OL,15,     Fthe place to a caravan park...
OL,16,G1100 Four in a Bed
OL,17,     FOn payment day, the B&Bers take
OL,18,     Feach other to task on everything
OL,19,     Ffrom insufficient slumber to
OL,20,     Fhopeless hosting, before we find
OL,21,     Fout who's won the week.
